From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(workspaces): wire broker handoffs into Kanban lifecycle

Connect board- and run-scoped plugin hooks to broker capture, import,
activation cleanup, recovery, export, and notifier delivery without adding
Hermes authority tables or columns. The broker remains authoritative for
leases, frozen trees, export tokens, and operation replay.

Expose only /workspace and relative output manifests to broker workers. Hide
host paths, attachment-upload authority, and internal ids; store exported bytes
as idempotent native attachments and never infer files from summary or result
prose.

Under the trusted handoff feature, keep the Swarm root metadata-only and
nonexecuting while its workers, verifier, and synthesizer receive independent
broker workspaces. Multi-parent filesystem merging remains deliberately absent.
---
